name=LX Split-Screen Skills Boost
id=LX_SPLITSCREEN_SKILLS_IMPROVE
author=litoxperaloca
description=Brings every local character (split-screen included) up to a skill floor, once per character, so a couch co-op run can start building and fighting straight away instead of grinding. By default: Strength, Fitness, Aiming and Reloading to 10, and Carpentry, Metalworking, Electrical, Mechanics, Masonry, Blacksmith, Carving, Tailoring, Pottery, Glassmaking and Butchering to 5. Both levels are adjustable in Options - MODS, and 0 leaves that group untouched. Levels are only ever RAISED, never lowered, and the recipes those levels unlock are learned automatically. Reloading a save never repeats it; a new character gets it again; raising the floor later tops up existing characters. EN/ES.
